[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584398\">1044B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584497\">1060G50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Loosen the band and remove the coolant pipe between the water/exhaust\ngas heat exchanger and the thermostat unit.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Recover the coolant which comes\nout in a suitable container.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021986.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the coolant pipe between the exhaust\ngas/water heat exchanger and the thermostat unit back in its housing\nand secure it using the bands.</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584497\">1060G50</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584398\">1044B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Refill the engine cooling system with coolant \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/2584122\">0010T20</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]